   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1942-04-21">April 21. 1942</date></dateline><lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__313" type="person">Mr. H. Budzislawski</rs><lb/> c/o <rs
                  ref="#tillich_person_id__1915" type="person">Mrs. Dorothy Thompson</rs>.<lb/> 237
               East 48 Str.<lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York City</rs><lb/>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__313" type="person">Mr.
                  Budzislawski</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>When I accepted the collaboration in your shortwave broadcasting to <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__122"
                  type="place">Germany</rs> I told you that I could do it only if I would find
               collaboration. In the meantime I have asked some people whether they would help me in
               preparing the weekly speeches. They expressed their willingness in principle but at
               the same time they pointed to the fact that their financial situation would not allow
               them to give time to such a work without receiving at least some financial help. I
               myself am in a similar situation since I give already more than half of my time to
               unpaid work. Therefore I ask you to get in touch with <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1915" type="person">Mrs.
                  Thompson</rs> and the people of the Columbia Broadcasting system in order to
               provide some financial support. As I see the situation the entire work will break
               down in the long run if this comparatively small sum can not be raised.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Cordially yours</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                  >Paul Tillich</rs></signed>
               Professor at Union Theological Seminary. <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York City</rs><lb/>
            D.D. h.c. Yale University.</closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
